  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Unity Version: 2022.3.22f1\n\nSDK Version: Base 3.8.0, Worlds 3.8.0\n\nFollowing the [documentation on the VRChat website](https://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/udon/udonsharp/configuration/), I have disabled **Auto compile on modify** , yet any time I save an UdonSharp script, Unity will refresh and recompile. I'd like to disable auto compile and just have the option to compile manually, but the options in the Project Settings menu seem to have no effect.",
